{"id": 106, "stem": "<div class=\"relative w-full min-w-0 max-w-full self-stretch\" id=\"question-text\"><span><p class=\"mb-4 text-start\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem;\"><mark class=\"bg-transparent dark:text-neutral-100\" data-markjs=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">A</mark> 38-year-old man is undergoing treatment for acute myeloid leukemia.\u00a0 Initially, he had fevers and reported being lethargic and fatigued all the time.\u00a0 However, of late, he has noted increasingly severe right-sided headaches.\u00a0 He describes the pain to be throbbing in nature and located behind his right eye.\u00a0 He also has associated nasal stuffiness.\u00a0 The patient has no prior history of allergies.\u00a0 Physical examination reveals right-sided proptosis and periorbital tenderness.\u00a0 Biopsy of the right maxillary sinus mucosa reveals the following:</p><div class=\"mb-4 text-start flex justify-start items-start\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem;\"><div class=\"group/triggerable\" data-is-open=\"false\"><div class=\"group/draggable\" data-is-draggable=\"true\" data-is-dragging=\"false\"><div class=\"group/resizable relative\" data-is-maximized=\"false\" data-is-resizable=\"true\" data-is-resizing=\"false\"><div class=\"w-full\"><button class=\"lg:max-w-lg md:max-w-md w-fit max-w-full my-5 hover:scale-[1.01] transition-[transform,_box-shadow] ease-in-out duration-500 hover:shadow-lg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-none\" src=\"../../Assets/images/ubihno9jpsnaind37j6cbv0t.png\"/></button></div></div></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-4 text-start\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem;\">Which of the following is the most likely cause of this patient's condition?\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u